  "title": "ieee80211-radio: Add support for MCS index 14 & 15",
  "description": "EHT packets support MCS index values from 0 to 15. Currently Wireshark only support MCS values from 0 to 13; MSC index values 14 and 15 are considered invalid. This MR adds support for MCS index 14 and 15.  \n\nFixes #20270 \n    \nI sort of guessed the value for `ieee80211_mcsinfo.data_bits_per_symbol`, this variable is only used for `VHT` packets so thoses values will never be used.",
